{
 "about": "A GENERAL PIP whose body is the number 5 or the boolean true, on the left of IN, CONTAINS, NOT CONTAINS and CONTAINS ANY. Round 20 showed such a body matching nothing on the right of ==, !=, IN, NOT IN, and on the left of NOT CONTAINS ANY; on these four left sides the goldens do not tell a false comparison from an ended rule. Each comparison stands in the OR probe of an ALLOW rule and of a DENY rule, asked with resource.a 'n' and 'y'. The right side holds the body's own text, so a body compared as text would match.",
